# Copy to .env (for `npm start`) or .dev.vars (for `npm run preview`). On
# Cloudflare, add it as a secret: `npx wrangler secret put AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`,
# or Worker → Settings → Variables and Secrets in the dashboard.

# Optional, so it stays commented out here: a Vercel AI Gateway key, from the
# Vercel dashboard → AI Gateway → API Keys (https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway).
# Without it the server replays one recorded answer, so the app runs without
# an account and costs nothing.
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# Optional. Any AI Gateway model id; defaults to anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5.
# MODEL=openai/gpt-5
